    description_zh: "使用商家自有应用管理 Lazada 商品、价格、库存、订单、发货、售后、促销和广告；需相应店铺业务权限。",
    description_en: "Use a merchant-owned app to manage Lazada products, prices, stock, orders, shipment, after-sales, promotions and ads with the required shop permissions.",
    description_es: "Usa tu app para gestionar productos, precios, existencias, pedidos, envíos, posventa, promociones y anuncios Lazada con los permisos de la tienda.",
